Conclusion: no seven two-qubit product rays reproduce all 21 target
transition probabilities. Therefore an exactly separable strategy cannot
saturate W=3/4. Compactness implies Q_SEP<3/4, but this calculation does
not provide a numerical positive lower bound on 3/4-Q_SEP.
